      "side": 1,
      "message": "It might be more readable to move some of the new code from this change into a `VkEmulatedPhysicalDeviceQueues.[cpp|h]` in the same way that `VkEmulatedPhysicalDeviceMemory.h` is used for emulating memory. I think this has the benefit hiding `mEnableVirtualVkQueue` from a lot of functions in `VkDecoderGlobalState` in the same way `EmulatedPhysicalDeviceMemoryProperties` hides a bunch of \n\n```\nif (features.VulkanAllocateDeviceMemoryOnly.enabled) {\n  // do thing 1\n} else {\n  // do thing 2\n}\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1717,
        "startChar": 8,
