      "writtenOn": "2024-11-22T13:38:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Acknowledged, makes sense. But similar to making it a feature bit, I think it\u0027d be better to keep the impact radius on this small until we find all the necessary changes needed. It\u0027s currently not clear if HWUI requires full render state tracking to reuse the same virtual queue after doing some other work on the physical queue. That would require something similar to what snapshots are doing, with runtime reconstruction. Probably until that\u0027s cleared out, this should stay as a CL.",
