      "writtenOn": "2024-11-21T14:21:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC - you are hardcoding an assumption here that the virtual queue will always be part of the same family as the physicalQueue. I think this probably needs to be called out with a comment in case we need to extend this in the future to make the intention clear (at this time we\u0027re only interested in supporting HWUI which uses 2 of the same queues)\n\nI can imagine we\u0027d have cases for applications where this is not always applicable and they can use a queue that is from a different family, right?",
      "revId": "eeccf5f8bb867ac5f85b5e8a8aadfcba2b7fdc63",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
